    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Constitution, Intelligence</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.feats.Item.phbftAlert000000]{Alert}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Sleight of Hand and Stealth</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> Thieves’ Tools</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.equipment.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Daggers}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.equipment.Item.phbtulThievesToo]{Thieves’ Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.equipment.Item.phbagCrowbar0000]{Crowbar}, 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.equipment.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouches}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.items.Item.SsAmWV6YBqeOFihT]{Traveler's Clothes}, 16 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p><p>You eked out a living in dark alleyways, cutting purses or burgling shops. Perhaps you were part of a small gang of like-minded wrongdoers who looked out for each other. Or maybe you were a lone wolf, fending for yourself against the local thieves’ guild and more fearsome lawbreakers.</p>",
